        <description>Nobody here ever really liked me. I'm finally leaving to find somewhere I belong, and I couldn't be happier about it.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>6</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
