  <!-- Reunion thoughts for a colonist leaving to join a visiting relation,
       one per FarewellUtility.JoinBond (granted on accept, so the boost is
       visible while they walk over). {0} = the visitor. Gender-specific
       wording (husband/wife, son/daughter, ...) comes from
       "{defName}_SubjMale/SubjFemale_label/desc" Keyed strings via
       Thought_MemoryWithSubject; the text below is the neutral fallback.
       PF_ReunitedWithLovedOne above is no longer granted, kept only so
       older saves holding it still load. -->

