    <!-- Granted as a "permanent" Thought_Memory in code (see
         FarewellUtility.GiveNotLikedHereThought), so this duration is never
         actually used to expire it - we add/remove it ourselves whenever the
         loneliness condition starts/stops being met. Kept small so the Needs
         tab tooltip never shows a nonsensical "expires in..." line if this
         thought is ever granted without the permanent flag set. -->
